    "html": "<p>A rubber ball of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.20\\text{ kg}\"></span> strikes a horizontal floor with a vertical speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span> and rebounds with a vertical speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span>. The ball is in contact with the floor for a duration of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.10\\text{ s}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the average net force exerted on the ball during the collision?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\\text{ N}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\\text{ N}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"16\\text{ N}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"20\\text{ N}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
